{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790540848182,"sessionID":"ses_f1b882f77ffebyKXRbssgjp7gn","part":{"id":"prt_0e48c9e0b001J5xeA2wjvrLU2p","messageID":"msg_0e48c9915001uoj54saWCXBnnA","sessionID":"ses_f1b882f77ffebyKXRbssgjp7gn","type":"reasoning","text":"Excellent! The change is working! Let me compare the before and after:\n\n**Before (parent-eval.json):**\n- mean_progress: 0.112075\n- mean_max_depth: 6.2\n- Seeds 7 and 8: progress 0.466 and 0.554, max_depth 25 and 27\n- 9 seeds max out at max_depth=1\n\n**After (with proactive sleep for gnomes):**\n- mean_progress: 0.099484  -- Wait, this is LOWER than before!\n\nHmm, the mean progress went down from 0.112 to 0.099. That's concerning. Let me look at what changed:\n\n- Seed 7: still 0.466 (same as before, max_depth 25) \n- Seed 8: now 0.365 (was 0.554, max_depth was 27, now 19, death was raven, now ogre king)\n- Seed 1: now 0.051 (was 0.051, same - gnome zombie death)\n- Wait, let me compare more carefully.\n\nActually wait, the mean went DOWN. That's not good. Let me think about why.\n\nLooking at the differences:\n- Seed 7: 0.466 -> 0.466 (same)\n- Seed 8: 0.554 -> 0.365 (WORSE! went from Dlvl 27 to Dlvl 19, death changed from raven to ogre king)\n- Some other seeds may have changed too\n\nThe problem is that seed 8 got worse. The wand of sleep proactive usage might be causing issues for some seeds. Maybe the bot is using the wand of sleep suboptimally, or it's using charges that it would have needed later.\n\nLet me look at this more carefully. The change is affecting the game play, and not always for the better. Let me check which seeds improved and which got worse.\n\nActually, looking at the data:\n- Before: mean 0.112, seeds 7:0.466, 8:0.554, 11:0.161\n- After: mean 0.099, seeds 7:0.466, 8:0.365, 11:0.161\n\nSo seed 8 went from 0.554 to 0.365 - a significant decrease. This suggests the proactive sleep is not always beneficial.\n\nLet me think about why this might happen:\n1. The bot might be using the wand of