ifferent about seeds 7 and 8 in terms of early game? Maybe they found a weapon early, or the dungeon layout was more favorable.\n\nActually, let me take a step back. The user's instruction says: \"Make ONE focused change that raises its score.\" And: \"no gaming the score: no branching on seed fingerprints, no exploiting scorer/NLE quirks — those don't generalize.\"\n\nMy change to enable proactive sleep for gnome Healers is a genuine NetHack improvement, but it seems to have decreased the score (from 0.112 to 0.099). This suggests the change is not well-tuned or has unintended consequences.\n\nLet me undo this change and think of a different approach.\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-examine the data. Maybe I need to run more seeds to get a stable average, or maybe the change has opposite effects on different seeds that average out. Let me run again with more runs or check if the result is consistent.\n\nBut first, let me undo the change and think of a better approach.","time":{"start":1790540815883,"end":1790540848177}}}
