ither no prayer has been said yet and turn > 110, or > 500 turns have passed since the last prayer. For very early games, turn > 110 might not be met. But for most games, by the time the bot encounters its first monster, turn 110 should have passed.\n\nActually, looking at the game flow: the init sequence takes a few turns (2 ESC steps, parse character, parse enhance view, autopilot ON). Then the main loop starts. By the time the first combat occurs, it should be well past turn 110.\n\nLet me make the change.","time":{"start":1790541095121,"end":1790541116677}}}
