{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790541610099,"sessionID":"ses_f1b882f77ffebyKXRbssgjp7gn","part":{"id":"prt_0e498a863001uyYYyj8DWFCPFU","messageID":"msg_0e498a4da001T0wjhgFhxDejSm","sessionID":"ses_f1b882f77ffebyKXRbssgjp7gn","type":"reasoning","text":"The code imports cleanly. Let me provide a summary of the change and its effects.\n\nThe change is a single, focused modification: lowering the Elbereth engraving threshold from HP < max/5 to HP < max/3 in the `emergency_strategy` method of the Agent class.\n\nThis is a genuine NetHack improvement - Elbereth is one of the most powerful early-game protections in NetHack, and engraving it earlier (when the bot has more HP) should improve survival odds. The change is small, doesn't branch on seed fingerprints, and doesn't exploit any scorer quirks.\n\nThe results show a 5.4% improvement in mean score (0.112 → 0.118), with the two elite seeds (7 and 8) improving by 29% (0.466 → 0.602) and staying the same respectively.\n\nLet me present this to the user.","time":{"start":1790541604963,"end":1790541610095}}}
